Project: Airtable Clone
- Use create.t3.gg, deploy on Vercel
- Use TanStack Table & TanStack Virtual
- Use PostgreSQL as DB, TRPC for backend
- Main page = table with rows, columns, and cells (like Airtable but not 1:1)
- Google login via Clerk
- Users can create bases, each base has tables
- Dynamically add Text and Number columns
- Smooth inline cell editing and tabbing
- Tables show default data using FakerJS
- Add 100k rows via button, support infinite scroll (no lag)
- Search, filter, and sort done at DB level
- Views can save column filters (>, <, contains, empty), sort order, and hidden columns
- Add loading states
- Should scale to 1M rows

